	(text "Expansion port J8 (2x32) carries image load, weight load, START, RESET and status.\nLOAD_EN=1 tri-states the system path and enables U92..U96.\nU92 DIR = LOAD_nOE: 1 = host write, 0 = host read-back.  U93/U94 drive ADDR[15:0];\nU95 drives ADDR[23:16] = {GND,GND,GND,MEM_SEL[4:0]} so the S04 tag check always sees\nthe memory select the host requested.  U96 drives MEM_SEL[4:0] and LOAD_nWE/nOE.\nH_A[15:0] have 10k pull-downs (RN1/RN2); H_MEM_SEL[4:0] pull-downs; controls idle high.\nJ8 pin 38 is RESET_RAW (same node as SW1/J3): drive it open-drain, never push-pull.\nJ8 pin 37 is START_RAW (same node as J2); U91 synchronises it to CLK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 540 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8316087e-c1a8-44ca-88d0-c14f08493c66")
	)

	(text "Status: BUSY/DONE/RESULT_VALID/ERROR/RESULT[3:0]/ERROR_CODE[3:0] and the READY flags are\nbuffered by U97/U98 to J_STATUS and the LEDs.  IMAGE_READY/MODEL_READY are generated in S04;\nS10 only monitors them.  Test points TP1..TP10 are on the named global nets.\nPower: +5 V from J_PWR, 10 uF + 100 nF bulk, one 100 nF per IC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 558 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "af606935-ee3c-463b-bca6-13cd29326bfd")
	)

	(embedded_fonts no)
)
